{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your squad to victory in <i>Tactical Battles</i>, a fast-paced turn-based strategy RPG packed with clever mechanics, surprising twists, and limitless possibilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the battlefield with deep tactical options and character progression that rewards creativity and risk-taking. Upgrade classes, command your team, and shape the fight with every move.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Farm infinite extra attacks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f <strong>Steal powerful attack skills and abilities</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Complete quests and mini-games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Manipulate elemental terrain &amp; status effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf09 <strong>Build bridges</strong>\u00a0:move safely through dangerous zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Upgrade your class</strong> to unlock devastating new skills and dramatically boost your stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to outsmart the enemy, upgrade your hero, and take on the ultimate Tactical Battle?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/9851cf4384f7132e4458a583e60040a3154178d0.jpg"},{"name":"The Robot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/743b1273515396139f9b9673e907121ab1632c4b.jpg"},{"name":"Father Nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/157c6340e5cb7c017294eeb29d99cc13902bf1f0.jpg"},{"name":"The Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3310350/550e8b4a6c89cdda4